    "licenceDecision": "Treated as public domain by the practitioner on 2026-10-17. The 1863 source is out of copyright by age, the records are facts about an 1861 outbreak, and the table has passed openly between studies for thirty years with no holder claiming rights. The structured arrangement is Oesterle's 1992 reanalysis and is not public domain by age, so this is a judgement about copyrightable subject matter and not a licence grant. See docs/research/data-sources.md.",
